<section id="ddb-importer-muncher-help" class="tab ddb-muncher {{ tab.cssClass }} {{#if tab.active}} active{{/if}}" data-group="{{tab.group}}" data-tab="{{tab.id}}">
    <fieldset>
    <legend>FAQ</legend>
    <ul>
      <li>Homebrew monsters need to be part of your Homebrew Collection on D&D Beyond.</li>
      <li>Spells and Items should take only a few minutes at most.</li>
      <li>If munching seems to stall, you can refresh your browser and try again. As long as "Update existing things" remains unchecked, it will skip existing items and pick up where it left off.</li>
    </ul>
    </fieldset>
    <fieldset>
    <legend>Troubleshooting</legend>
    <ul>
      <li>Ensure your self-hosted proxy is running and reachable via the Proxy URL setting in Settings.</li>
      <li>If using Cobalt authentication, confirm your Cobalt Cookie is valid in Settings.</li>
      <li>Check the browser Developer Console (F12) to see live munch progress notes.</li>
    </ul>

    <button data-action="openDebug" type="button" id="ddb-open-debug">Open DDB Muncher Debug Tool</button>

    </fieldset>
</section>
